Syntax: cast 'distort' <target>

The Distort ritual calls upon malevolent loa to twist and entangle the
victim's spirit from within. By disrupting the connection between body
and soul, the shaman inflicts significant internal damage that bypasses
physical armor and defenses.

This attack ritual is a fundamental offensive tool of the houngan,
dealing damage that scales with the caster's level and skill. The
spiritual nature of the damage makes it difficult to resist through
conventional means, though strong-willed victims may partially
withstand the assault.

Distort serves as the foundation for more powerful spiritual attacks
such as Death Wave, which extends the effect to multiple targets.

See Also: DEATH WAVE, SOUL TWIST, BOILING BLOOD
